@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

[*] --> INITIAL_STATE
INITIAL_STATE --> ServiceCenterHome : LOGIN_EVENT
ServiceCenterHome --> DestinationSelection : DESTINATION_SELECTED_EVENT
DestinationSelection --> JourneyDetailsDisplay : DISPLAY_JOURNEY_DETAILS_EVENT
JourneyDetailsDisplay --> DrivingModeActivation : ACTIVATE_DRIVING_MODE_OR_OTHER_OPTIONS_EVENT
DrivingModeActivation --> EatingPlaceSelection : SELECT_PLACE_TO_EAT_EVENT
EatingPlaceSelection --> MenuView : VIEW_MENU_EVENT
MenuView --> OrderPlacement : PLACE_ORDER_IF_HUNGRY_EVENT
OrderPlacement --> AccidentDetection : INFORM_RELEVANT_AUTHORITIES_IN_EVENT_OF_ACCIDENT_EVENT
AccidentDetection --> NotificationSend : SEND_NOTIFICATIONS_EVENT
NotificationSend --> Logout : NOTIFICATION_COMPLETED_EVENT
Logout --> [*] : LOGOUT_COMPLETED_EVENT
@enduml
